+
+### T4: staged emitter
+
+The harness used:
+
+```text
+box/orderbasis-20260903/meta/25_15_21_2_k2_part_3_full.json
+box/orderbasis-20260903/rows/25_15_21_2_k2_part_3_full_rows.tsv
