+## 7. Seal
+
+Machine artifact index:
+
+```text
+box/sysguidedgb-20260903/runs/T1_t5/
+  T1_t5_b0_p1009.sing/.out/.err/.guided.json
+  T1_t5_b1_p1009.sing/.out/.err/.guided.json
