+INPUTS PASS: 12 charged inputs verified via box/sysguidedgb-20260903/charged_inputs.sha256sum.log
+T1_card_a START
+T1 t=5 PASS: both fibres DIM0_CHAR0, length=3640, perturbed controls failed, wall=3.03s
