+```text
+box/g108gate-20260903/runs/delta3/stage0/death_replay.sing
+```
+
+Submitted generators:
+
+```text
+minor_n6_pi0
+minor_n7_pi0
+minor_n7_pi1
+minor_n8_pi0
+minor_n8_pi1
+L
+```
+
+Result:
