+```
+
+So the staged files preserve exactly the same labelled generator set as the
+monolithic ideal source, without writing a monolithic ideal file.
+
+## 7. Seal
+
+Machine artifact index:
+
+```text
+box/sysguidedgb-20260903/runs/T1_t5/
